    "summary": "Kling VIDEO 2.6 Pro is a full audio-visual AI video model that combines cinematic-quality video generation with native audio (dialogue, sound effects, ambience), with optional Motion Control for precise character movement via the API.",
    "description": "Kling VIDEO 2.6 Pro is a full audio-visual AI video model that combines cinematic-quality video generation with native audio (dialogue, sound effects, ambience). It supports flexible workflows from text or image input, delivering synchronized video and sound in one pass with strong consistency and creative control. Via the API, Motion Control enables creators to guide character movement using a reference video for more realistic and physically grounded motion.",
